WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.015 --> 00:00:01.498
All right, guys, gather round. Time for the

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:03.000
Week 14 playoff picture

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.291
Hey, AB, what do you like better?

00:00:04.291 --> 00:00:06.208
Gucci Steampunk Wonka or Prep Schoolboy

00:00:06.208 --> 00:00:06.958
With a Secret?

00:00:06.958 --> 00:00:08.541
I don't know. They both look pretty stupid

00:00:08.541 --> 00:00:10.500
Antonio, can you help me with my toppy-tail?

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:12.416
Hey, Goff, how do I look? Be honest!

00:00:12.416 --> 00:00:13.416
Oh you know, below average

00:00:14.083 --> 00:00:15.500
Serviceable, I guess? But what are you

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:16.375
gonna do at this point?

00:00:16.375 --> 00:00:17.208
Dope, dope

00:00:17.208 --> 00:00:20.125
OK, Alex Smith. Move a little further to your left

00:00:20.541 --> 00:00:21.166
Further

00:00:21.416 --> 00:00:22.083
Further

00:00:22.083 --> 00:00:23.083
Is this good?

00:00:23.083 --> 00:00:23.583
Perfect

00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:28.583
OK, guys, enough silly photos, long shots out

00:00:28.583 --> 00:00:30.458
Let's get the real playoff teams back in here

00:00:30.458 --> 00:00:32.333
Xavier Rhodes, can you go a little to your right?

00:00:32.333 --> 00:00:33.250
You're covering Julio

00:00:33.250 --> 00:00:34.250
Damn right I am!

00:00:34.250 --> 00:00:35.916
Excuse me, am I even in this thing?

00:00:35.916 --> 00:00:36.708
No, not really

00:00:36.708 --> 00:00:40.125
OK, on three, everyone, let's say 'the Jags, really?'

00:00:40.125 --> 00:00:42.291
HEY, HEY, HEY, NUH, UH, UH, BILLS GUY,

00:00:42.291 --> 00:00:43.000
YOU GET OUT

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:44.000
Oh come on, just five quick pics

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:45.416
Would you just sit next to the other

00:00:45.416 --> 00:00:46.375
bench quarterbacks?

00:00:46.625 --> 00:00:48.666
Eli! We're the same, eh?

00:00:48.666 --> 00:00:49.666
Kill me

00:00:49.666 --> 00:00:52.083
OK, almost done. Let's just do realistic

00:00:52.083 --> 00:00:54.708
contenders only, so Titans you're out

00:00:54.708 --> 00:00:57.875
Jags out, Li-, ha, Lions definitely out

00:00:57.875 --> 00:00:58.985
Anddd smile

